<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>À propos · {{ site.name }}</title>
<meta name="description" content="À propos de {{ site.name }} : qui nous sommes, notre méthode éditoriale et notre auteur.">
<link rel="canonical" href="{{ site.domain }}/a-propos/">
{% if site.favicon_file is defined and site.favicon_file %}<link rel="icon" href="{{ site.favicon_file }}">{% else %}<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">{% endif %}
{% if site.google_site_verification is defined and site.google_site_verification %}<meta name="google-site-verification" content="{{ site.google_site_verification }}">{% endif %}
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400;1,500;1,600&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
<!-- ══ NAV ══ -->
{% include 'base/_nav.html.j2' %}

<!-- ══ 1. HERO ══ -->
<section style="background: #1C2733; min-height: 560px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: flex; align-items: center;">
  <div style="position: absolute; left: -130px; top: -220px; width: 230px; height: 1060px; background: #0F3D5E; transform: rotate(-22deg); transform-origin: center; z-index: 0;"></div>
  <div style="position: absolute; left: 62px; top: -220px; width: 155px; height: 1060px; background: #1D70A2; transform: rotate(-22deg); transform-origin: center; opacity: 0.85; z-index: 0;"></div>
  <div style="position: absolute; right: -100px; top: -220px; width: 320px; height: 1060px; background: #168551; transform: rotate(-22deg); transform-origin: center; opacity: 0.45; z-index: 0;"></div>

  <div style="max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 72px; position: relative; z-index: 1; padding: 72px 56px; width: 100%;">
    <!-- Photo auteur -->
    <div style="flex: 0 0 420px; height: 420px; border-radius: 30px; overflow: hidden; position: relative; box-shadow: 0 24px 64px rgba(0,0,0,0.45); flex-shrink: 0;">
      {% if site.author_photo is defined and site.author_photo %}
      <img src="{{ site.author_photo }}" alt="{{ author.name or 'Alexandre Michel' }}" style="position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover;">
      {% else %}
      <!-- Fond portrait -->
      <div style="position: absolute; inset: 0; background: repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg, #243040 0px, #243040 18px, #1a2530 18px, #1a2530 36px);"></div>
      <!-- Avatar grand format -->
      <div style="position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 18px;">
        <div style="width: 130px; height: 130px; border-radius: 50%; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0F3D5E, #1D70A2); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 44px; font-weight: 700; color: #FFFFFF; box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); border: 3px solid rgba(29,112,162,0.4);">AM</div>
        <div style="text-align: center;">
          <div style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); margin-bottom: 4px;">Alexandre Michel</div>
          <div style="font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 12.5px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); letter-spacing: 0.04em;">Fondateur · CreaOne</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
      <!-- Badge Toulouse -->
      <div style="position: absolute; bottom: 24px; left: 24px; background: rgba(22,133,81,0.9); padding: 7px 14px; border-radius: 999px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;">
        <div style="width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FFFFFF;"></div>
        <span style="font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 500;">Toulouse, France</span>
      </div>
      <!-- Badge expérience -->
      <div style="position: absolute; top: 24px; right: 24px; background: #0F3D5E; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 10px;">
        <div style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #FFFFFF; line-height: 1; text-align: center;">9</div>
        <div style="font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 10px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); line-height: 1.3; text-align: center; margin-top: 2px;">ans d'exp.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Texte droite -->
    <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 0;">
      <span style="display: inline-block; background: rgba(22,133,81,0.15); color: #168551; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 999px; margin-bottom: 28px;">À propos de CreaOne</span>
      <h1 style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 62px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.07; color: #FFFFFF; margin: 0 0 26px;">Nous aidons les<br><span style="color: #1D70A2;">créateurs</span><br>à réussir leur<br>lancement.</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); margin: 0 0 44px; max-width: 420px;">CreaOne est un média indépendant dédié à l'entrepreneuriat. Analyses rigoureuses, ressources pratiques et conseils d'experts pour chaque étape de votre parcours.</p>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <a href="#" style="background: #168551; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 15px 32px; border-radius: 8px; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(22,133,81,0.3); transition: background 0.18s;" style-hover="background: #137447;">Découvrir nos guides</a>
        <a href="#methodologie" style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; border-bottom: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); padding-bottom: 3px; padding-top: 15px; transition: border-color 0.18s, color 0.18s;" style-hover="color: #FFFFFF; border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);">Notre méthodologie →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ 2. POURQUOI ══ -->
<section style="background: #FFFFFF; padding: 96px 56px;">
  <div style="max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: center;">

    <div data-fade="1">
      <span style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.13em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #1D70A2; display: block; margin-bottom: 18px;">Pourquoi CreaOne existe</span>
      <h2 style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 40px; font-weight: 700; color: #1C2733; margin: 0 0 24px; line-height: 1.18;">Créer une entreprise est<br><em style="font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-style: italic; font-weight: 600; color: #0F3D5E;">l'une des décisions les<br>plus importantes.</em></h2>
      <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.82; color: #4A5A6B; margin-bottom: 22px;">Se lancer sans les bonnes informations, c'est risquer des mois perdus, un mauvais statut juridique, des aides ratées. Les conséquences peuvent être lourdes : financières, fiscales, sociales.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.82; color: #4A5A6B; margin-bottom: 36px;">CreaOne est né de ce constat : les entrepreneurs méritent des analyses rigoureuses, indépendantes, gratuites, pas des contenus marketing déguisés en conseils.</p>
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px;">
          <div style="width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #168551; flex-shrink: 0;"></div>
          <span style="font-size: 14.5px; color: #1C2733;">Éviter les erreurs coûteuses dès le départ</span>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px;">
          <div style="width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #168551; flex-shrink: 0;"></div>
          <span style="font-size: 14.5px; color: #1C2733;">Accéder à des analyses indépendantes et vérifiées</span>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px;">
          <div style="width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #168551; flex-shrink: 0;"></div>
          <span style="font-size: 14.5px; color: #1C2733;">Gagner du temps sur les démarches administratives</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="creaone-stats" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 22px;">
      <div data-fade="1" style="background: #F4F7FA; border-radius: 18px; padding: 32px 26px; border: 1px solid #E2E8F0; text-align: center;">
        <div style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 50px; font-weight: 700; color: #0F3D5E; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 10px;">{{ cA }}</div>
        <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #64748B; line-height: 1.5;">Sujets analysés</div>
      </div>
      <div data-fade="1" style="background: #1C2733; border-radius: 18px; padding: 32px 26px; text-align: center;">
        <div style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 50px; font-weight: 700; color: #FFFFFF; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 10px;">{{ cB }}</div>
        <div style="font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.42); line-height: 1.5;">Heures de recherche</div>
      </div>
      <div data-fade="1" style="background: #168551; border-radius: 18px; padding: 32px 26px; text-align: center;">
        <div style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 50px; font-weight: 700; color: #FFFFFF; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 10px;">{{ cC }}</div>
        <div style="font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.68); line-height: 1.5;">Lecteurs / mois</div>
      </div>
      <div data-fade="1" style="background: #F4F7FA; border-radius: 18px; padding: 32px 26px; border: 1px solid #E2E8F0; text-align: center;">
        <div style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 50px; font-weight: 700; color: #168551; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 10px;">{{ cD }}</div>
        <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #64748B; line-height: 1.5;">Articles publiés</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ 3. VALEURS ══ -->
<section style="background: #F4F7FA; padding: 96px 56px;">
  <div style="max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 60px;">
      <span style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.13em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #1D70A2;">Nos valeurs</span>
      <h2 style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 38px; font-weight: 700; color: #1C2733; margin: 14px 0 0; line-height: 1.2;">Ce qui nous guide au quotidien</h2>
    </div>
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 24px;">

      <div data-fade="1" style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 18px; padding: 36px 30px; border: 1px solid #E2E8F0; transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;" style-hover="box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(15,61,94,0.1); transform: translateY(-5px);">
        <div style="width: 54px; height: 54px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0F3D5E, #1D70A2); border-radius: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 22px;">
          <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; color: #1C2733; margin-bottom: 12px;">Indépendance</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.72; color: #64748B;">Nos analyses sont construites sur des critères objectifs et documentés. Chaque recommandation repose sur une vérification rigoureuse, pas sur des relations commerciales.</p>
      </div>

      <div data-fade="1" style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 18px; padding: 36px 30px; border: 1px solid #E2E8F0; transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;" style-hover="box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(15,61,94,0.1); transform: translateY(-5px);">
        <div style="width: 54px; height: 54px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #168551, #0F8060); border-radius: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 22px;">
          <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; color: #1C2733; margin-bottom: 12px;">Transparence</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.72; color: #64748B;">Nous expliquons toujours notre raisonnement, nos sources et nos méthodes. Rien n'est opaque dans notre processus éditorial.</p>
      </div>

      <div data-fade="1" style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 18px; padding: 36px 30px; border: 1px solid #E2E8F0; transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;" style-hover="box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(15,61,94,0.1); transform: translateY(-5px);">
        <div style="width: 54px; height: 54px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1D70A2, #0F3D5E); border-radius: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 22px;">
          <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="6"></circle><path d="M15.477 12.89L17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; color: #1C2733; margin-bottom: 12px;">Expertise</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.72; color: #64748B;">Chaque article est rédigé ou relu par un expert du domaine concerné. La précision juridique et fiscale est une priorité absolue.</p>
      </div>

      <div data-fade="1" style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 18px; padding: 36px 30px; border: 1px solid #E2E8F0; transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;" style-hover="box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(15,61,94,0.1); transform: translateY(-5px);">
        <div style="width: 54px; height: 54px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #168551, #1D70A2); border-radius: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 22px;">
          <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"></line><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"></line></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; color: #1C2733; margin-bottom: 12px;">Utilité</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.72; color: #64748B;">Notre unique mesure de succès : est-ce que ce contenu aide vraiment l'entrepreneur à prendre une meilleure décision ?</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ 4. MÉTHODOLOGIE ══ -->
<section id="methodologie" style="background: #FFFFFF; padding: 96px 56px;">
  <div style="max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: flex-start;">

      <div>
        <span style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.13em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #1D70A2; display: block; margin-bottom: 18px;">Notre processus</span>
        <h2 style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 38px; font-weight: 700; color: #1C2733; margin: 0 0 22px; line-height: 1.2;">Une méthodologie<br><em style="font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-style: italic; font-weight: 600; color: #0F3D5E;">rigoureuse.</em></h2>
        <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.82; color: #4A5A6B; margin-bottom: 0;">Chaque article publié sur CreaOne suit un processus éditorial en 7 étapes. Rien n'est publié sans avoir été vérifié, sourcé et validé par un expert du domaine.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">

        <div data-fade="1" style="display: flex; gap: 20px;">
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; flex-shrink: 0;">
            <div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; background: #0F3D5E; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #FFFFFF; flex-shrink: 0; z-index: 1;">1</div>
            <div style="width: 2px; background: #E2E8F0; flex: 1; margin: 6px 0; min-height: 36px;"></div>
          </div>
          <div style="padding-top: 8px; padding-bottom: 32px; flex: 1;">
            <div style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #1C2733; margin-bottom: 5px;">Identification du sujet</div>
            <p style="font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #64748B; margin: 0;">Sélection basée sur les questions réelles des entrepreneurs et les tendances du marché.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div data-fade="1" style="display: flex; gap: 20px;">
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; flex-shrink: 0;">
            <div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; background: #1D70A2; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #FFFFFF; flex-shrink: 0; z-index: 1;">2</div>
            <div style="width: 2px; background: #E2E8F0; flex: 1; margin: 6px 0; min-height: 36px;"></div>
          </div>
          <div style="padding-top: 8px; padding-bottom: 32px; flex: 1;">
            <div style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #1C2733; margin-bottom: 5px;">Recherche documentaire</div>
            <p style="font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #64748B; margin: 0;">Sources officielles, textes législatifs, jurisprudence, publications expertes et données de terrain.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div data-fade="1" style="display: flex; gap: 20px;">
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; flex-shrink: 0;">
            <div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; background: #168551; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #FFFFFF; flex-shrink: 0; z-index: 1;">3</div>
            <div style="width: 2px; background: #E2E8F0; flex: 1; margin: 6px 0; min-height: 36px;"></div>
          </div>
          <div style="padding-top: 8px; padding-bottom: 32px; flex: 1;">
            <div style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #1C2733; margin-bottom: 5px;">Tests et vérifications terrain</div>
            <p style="font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #64748B; margin: 0;">Simulation des démarches, vérification des chiffres, contact des organismes officiels si nécessaire.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div data-fade="1" style="display: flex; gap: 20px;">
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; flex-shrink: 0;">
            <div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; background: #0F3D5E; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #FFFFFF; flex-shrink: 0; z-index: 1;">4</div>
            <div style="width: 2px; background: #E2E8F0; flex: 1; margin: 6px 0; min-height: 36px;"></div>
          </div>
          <div style="padding-top: 8px; padding-bottom: 32px; flex: 1;">
            <div style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #1C2733; margin-bottom: 5px;">Rédaction structurée</div>
            <p style="font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #64748B; margin: 0;">Rédaction claire, sans jargon inutile, avec exemples concrets adaptés à chaque profil d'entrepreneur.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div data-fade="1" style="display: flex; gap: 20px;">
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; flex-shrink: 0;">
            <div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; background: #1D70A2; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #FFFFFF; flex-shrink: 0; z-index: 1;">5</div>
            <div style="width: 2px; background: #E2E8F0; flex: 1; margin: 6px 0; min-height: 36px;"></div>
          </div>
          <div style="padding-top: 8px; padding-bottom: 32px; flex: 1;">
            <div style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #1C2733; margin-bottom: 5px;">Relecture expert</div>
            <p style="font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #64748B; margin: 0;">Validation de la précision juridique, fiscale ou comptable par un professionnel du domaine.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div data-fade="1" style="display: flex; gap: 20px;">
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; flex-shrink: 0;">
            <div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; background: #168551; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #FFFFFF; flex-shrink: 0; z-index: 1;">6</div>
            <div style="width: 2px; background: #E2E8F0; flex: 1; margin: 6px 0; min-height: 36px;"></div>
          </div>
